# Plan — Task 162-026: src/cli/commands/ introspection audit

## Scope
READ-ONLY audit of:
- src/cli/commands/history.ts
- src/cli/commands/retro.ts
- src/cli/commands/explain.ts
- src/cli/commands/help.ts
- src/cli/commands/doctor.ts (35K — large)
- src/cli/commands/watch.ts

## Approach
1. Read each file fully (or in segments for doctor.ts)
2. For each, check 10 dimensions:
   1. Dead code (unused exports/imports)
   2. ADR violations (44 active, especially ADR-022-V2 CLI/MCP parity, ADR-010 single dep, ADR-011 readline, ADR-012 register pattern)
   3. Conflicting/duplicated logic
   4. Drift (claims vs reality)
   5. Type safety (any, ts-ignore, as unknown as)
   6. Dependency hygiene (.js extensions, circular deps)
   7. Documentation pollution
   8. Memory V2 coherence
   9. Config integrity
   10. Migration triage classification
3. Lead questions:
   - doctor Sprint 160 DECISIONS.md FAIL bug status
   - retro counter accuracy
   - metrics/output format consistency
4. Write SINGLE audit report to docs/audits/sprint-162-live/T-162-LIVE-026-cli-introspection.md
5. Each file gets: Findings (P0/P1/P2/P3), Evidence (file:line), Migration triage, Recommendation

## Output
docs/audits/sprint-162-live/T-162-LIVE-026-cli-introspection.md
